{"id":"0c3b82c1fc896440","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-orthogonalize.md","title":"Orthogonalization relation","display":"df-orthogonalize — Orthogonalization relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-orthogonalize","aliases":["27-df-orthogonalize"],"display":"df-orthogonalize — Orthogonalization relation","depends_on":["[[27-df-orthdnf]]","[[27-df-dnf]]"],"local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-orthogonalize"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-orthogonalize</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-orthogonalize — Orthogonalization relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5db086b596a0f700\" href=\"?note=5db086b596a0f700\" title=\"27-df-orthdnf\">27-df-orthdnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D,E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5db086b596a0f700\" href=\"?note=5db086b596a0f700\" title=\"27-df-orthdnf\">27-df-orthdnf</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n\\)</span> 是本节引入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> 上的二元关系定义目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n(D,E)\\leftrightarrow E\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n(D,E)\\leftrightarrow E\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源语境：Crama–Hammer (2011), §7.1，印刷页 327–329，PDF 第 351–353 页（从 1 计数）。本节点把“输出一个等价 ODNF”形式化为二元关系；这不是原书具体算法的确定性输出函数。正交表示可不唯一，定义不承诺复杂度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-orthdnf","status":"resolved","id":"5db086b596a0f700","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-orthdnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D,E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]。$\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n$ 是本节引入的 $\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ 上的二元关系定义目标。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-orthdnf","status":"resolved","id":"5db086b596a0f700","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D,E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]。$\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n$ 是本节引入的 $\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ 上的二元关系定义目标。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D,E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n(D,E)\\leftrightarrow E\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)","display":true}],"bytes":1158,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-orthogonalize|df-orthogonalize — Orthogonalization relation]]"},{"id":"960197535160cece","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]，$\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthogonalize]]。"}],"outgoing":["5db086b596a0f700","0b618255959ff4bc"]}